# beatmania IIDX (GQ863 VER. JAA), Konami 1999: as bmiidx-boot.his, whose game it is a revision or a sibling of.
# beatmania IIDX (1st style, Twinkle): first power-on from blank NVRAM, no inputs. MAME flags
# this set NOT_WORKING: the DVD player check needs RTS->CTS on the PS1's SIO1, which MAME's SIO
# lacks (PLAN.md section 21, TW-5). This run records where MAME stops; bmiidx-clear.his goes on
# from there with CTS.
game bmiidxa

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3600 quit
